menu "Aliro reader"

config ALIRO_READER_TASK_STACK_SIZE
    int "Reader task stack size (bytes)"
    default 8192
    help
        The Aliro transaction runs ECDH, ECDSA and AES-GCM on this task's
        stack. 8 KB is the size Espressif's own reference example uses.

config ALIRO_READER_TASK_PRIORITY
    int "Reader task priority"
    default 18
    help
        A tap has a hard real-time budget: the user device is only in the
        field while someone holds a phone to the reader. Keep this above
        housekeeping work.

config ALIRO_READER_TASK_CORE
    int "Reader task core"
    default 0
    range 0 1
    help
        Core to pin the reader task to. Ignored on single-core targets.

config ALIRO_READER_POLL_INTERVAL_MS
    int "Polling interval when no device is present (ms)"
    default 100

config ALIRO_READER_FAST_TRANSACTION_SLOTS
    int "Persistent fast-transaction key slots"
    default 20
    help
        Fast transactions skip the full handshake for a device that has
        already been seen, which is the difference between a tap that feels
        instant and one that does not. 0 disables fast transactions.

endmenu
